Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:00:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [fix](bl31): rebuild cv181x bl31 with opteed and remove boot
 logs

[description ]: Rebuild bl31.bin 24592B->28696B, fsbl se9_release ba4aaf2
  SPD=opteed LOG_LEVEL=0; efuse/dump OK on cv1815ja_wevb_0020a_spinand
[root   cause]: 4c0f210 rebuilt bl31 without SPD=opteed, so OEM SMC call
  0x03000006 (efuse read) returned 0xffffffff instead of data
[JIRA      ID]: CV180X181X-4740
[chip project]: cv181x
[side effects]: BL31 boot logs gone (expected); STR unavailable because RTC
  SRAM payload is still an empty 0B blob; boot/SMC/efuse unaffected
[Affected *.ko/*.so/*.a] : NA
Change-Id: I6a854fa2dc8fa2b444472f4fefaed8ff06eddfa4
